  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced carrots and cook for 5 minutes, or until they start to soften.",
    "Add the sliced red bell pepper and cook for another 2 minutes, until the vegetables are tender.",
    "If using shio-cured salmon, stir it through the vegetables along with the chopped garlic.",
    "Add the peeled and deveined king prawns and cook for 2-3 minutes per side, or until they are pink and fully cooked.",
    "Stir through chopped fresh parsley, salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh dill and serve hot.",
    "Serve with lemon juice on the side for added flavor, if desired.",
    "Adjust seasoning and portion size as needed."
  ],
